  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Five courses on one great platter, each cut from a beast that cooks do not expect to see twice in a lifetime. The smell of it carries a mile, and it stays hot until the last plate is empty.</p><p><strong>Share the Banquet.</strong> The banquet takes an hour to eat and feeds up to eight creatures. Each one's Hit Point maximum increases by 10 for good. A creature can gain this benefit only once, and the banquet is used up.</p><p><strong>The Table Is Remembered.</strong> Those who ate the banquet together always know, afterward, whether each of the others is alive, and in which direction. When one of them dies, the others taste the meal again for a moment, wherever they are.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
